('advanced-native-1685', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1685-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["想一起做飯，但輪班時間使共同空檔少。"],"options":["姐姐已拒絕一起做飯，輪班時間完全沒影響。","兩人已固定每晚一起做飯，沒有時間衝突。","日記主要說蕾拉不喜歡任何烹調活動。","想一起做飯，但輪班時間使共同空檔少。"]},"advanced-native-1685-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The wish was there, but their daily schedules did not often match.","They needed an arrangement that could cope with different working hours.","Her lifestyle does not always cooperate because their free time rarely overlaps.","Changing shifts made shared evenings difficult to arrange."],"options":["The wish was there, but their daily schedules did not often match.","They needed an arrangement that could cope with different working hours.","Her lifestyle does not always cooperate because their free time rarely overlaps.","Changing shifts made shared evenings difficult to arrange."]},"advanced-native-1685-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["He wants to join, but his lifestyle does not always cooperate."],"options":["His missed sessions show he no longer has any interest in reading.","The story says the group has stopped offering meetings altogether.","He wants to join, but his lifestyle does not always cooperate."]},"advanced-native-1685-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["人物想做某事的意願一定不真誠。"],"options":["人物想做某事的意願一定不真誠。","應找出具體時間或環境阻礙，才可談改法。","日常條件可能與某意願衝突。"]},"advanced-native-1685-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["Her lifestyle does not always cooperate; the diary gives a scheduling problem, not a lack of affection."],"options":["Judge her wish only by the number of evenings they managed, without considering the changing shifts.","Treat the missed evenings as the sister’s refusal, even though the diary names working hours.","Her lifestyle does not always cooperate; the diary gives a scheduling problem, not a lack of affection."]},"advanced-native-1685-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["I want to help with the family audio project, but my lifestyle does not always cooperate with fixed rec