('advanced-native-1697', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1697-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["大家勸她不用獨力承擔，可分工及重排範圍。"],"options":["她正在排練劇中英雄角色的台詞。","剩餘頁數已全完成，討論只在分配獎項。","大家勸她不用獨力承擔，可分工及重排範圍。","大家要她退出整個項目，不再作任何貢獻。"]},"advanced-native-1697-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The unfinished pages were a shared responsibility, not hers alone.","We could divide the tasks and check which ones could wait.","Her offer was generous, but she did not need to carry the whole response by herself.","She did not have to play the hero when we could share the remaining work."],"options":["The unfinished pages were a shared responsibility, not hers alone.","We could divide the tasks and check which ones could wait.","Her offer was generous, but she did not need to carry the whole response by herself.","She did not have to play the hero when we could share the remaining work."]},"advanced-native-1697-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["You do not have to play the hero; let us agree which jobs each person can take."],"options":["Wait until the guests arrive before finding out which practical jobs the others could take.","You do not have to play the hero; let us agree which jobs each person can take.","Ask the helpers only to choose decorations while keeping all the practical jobs for yourself."]},"advanced-native-1697-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["對方應完全不理會別人遇到的需要。"],"options":["不用把困難全放自己身上。","對方應完全不理會別人遇到的需要。","仍可給自己應付得到的幫助並與人合作。"]},"advanced-native-1697-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["We appreciate her offer; she does not have to play the hero for her help to matter."],"options":["Keep the work entirely with her so that the team does not need to discuss its own responsibilities.","We appreciate her offer; she does not have to play the hero for her help to matter.","Accept her offer in full and wait until the deadline arrives before asking who else can help."]},"advanced-native-1697-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["You do not have to play the hero with every member’s question. Could I handle the two common categories first, then bring the unfamiliar cases to you for a discussion?","Please do not feel you must play the hero to spare the new helpers. I can take a clearly defined part of the replies and ask you about anything outside it."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
