('advanced-native-1713', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1713-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["他很容易便開始說故事，但故事不一定短。"],"options":["他只在有人事先把全部內容寫好時才讀出。","他很容易便開始說故事，但故事不一定短。","他需要反覆催促及幾天準備才願開始。","每個故事都在幾秒內結束。"]},"advanced-native-1713-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["He would tell a story at the drop of a hat if you asked one question.","One question was usually enough to get him started.","He was very ready to share the memory without much prompting.","Starting him off was easy, even if the story took a while to finish."],"options":["He would tell a story at the drop of a hat if you asked one question.","One question was usually enough to get him started.","He was very ready to share the memory without much prompting.","Starting him off was easy, even if the story took a while to finish."]},"advanced-native-1713-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["She will join a song at the drop of a hat."],"options":["She agrees to sing only a very short song, rather than responding quickly when invited.","She will join a song at the drop of a hat.","She agrees only after several planned rehearsals and repeated requests."]},"advanced-native-1713-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["整件事一定在極短時間內全部完成。"],"options":["容易便立即願意開始某事。","整件事一定在極短時間內全部完成。","需看情境才知道開始的行動及可用時間。"]},"advanced-native-1713-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["At the drop of a hat describes how readily he starts, not how long the story takes."],"options":["Ask for several days of preparation because a long story cannot begin readily.","At the drop of a hat describes how readily he starts, not how long the story takes.","Use the quick start as the timing for the entire story."]},"advanced-native-1713-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["I know you enjoy setting off at the drop of a hat, but I need more notice to arrange my family time. Could we choose a day next month instead?","Going on a trip at the drop of a hat sounds fun, but I cannot say yes for tomorrow morning. I would love to plan another date with e